      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "KEY:  model artifacts + backing runs move via the MLflow Registry API (control-plane PULL). The destination job stages into ITS OWN region bucket, then imports. Buckets are LOCAL staging only \u2014 there is NO bucket-to-bucket copy  =>  S3 CRR is NOT required.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "key",
      "originalText": "KEY:  model artifacts + backing runs move via the MLflow Registry API (control-plane PULL). The destination job stages into ITS OWN region bucket, then imports. Buckets are LOCAL staging only \u2014 there is NO bucket-to-bucket copy  =>  S3 CRR is NOT required.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 13
    },
